Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:47.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:49.12,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.12,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:56.57,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Senjou e! Zensen e! Soshite shi no fuchi made!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:15:01.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Inochi suteta sono kakugo wo shimese!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:05.22,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Kikoeru darou ano housei ga
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:13.02,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Teikou suru uji no koe da
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:17.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Fumitsubuse! Fumitsubuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.20,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Shokun, wareware no ninmu wa nanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:20.05,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Senmetsu da!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:22.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Ikki nokorazu no senmetsu da!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.90,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Nasubeki koto wa tada hitotsu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\blur8\3c&H1E23D6&}Jigoku wo tsukure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:28.77,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur8}Dangan no ame ni utare ni yuku no ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:34.97,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Shoushi senban! Kuni no tame da!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.60,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Senjou e! Zensen e! Soshite shi no fuchi made!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.80,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Inochi suteta kakugo wo shimese yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:46.58,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Chuusei wo! Juujun wo! Soshite sono tamashii wo-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:51.02,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Subete sasage kachidoki wo age yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:55.02,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Saa koko ni kizuite misero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:16:01.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Ten ni todoku hito no yama wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.16,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:05.16,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.16,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Feuer! Sperrfeuer! Los!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.07,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Achtung! Deckung! Hinlegen! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:47.10,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Fogo! Fogo de barragem! Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:49.08,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Atenção! Proteja-se! Abaixe-se! Pare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.12,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Fogo! Fogo de barragem! Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:53.00,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Atenção! Proteja-se! Abaixe-se! Pare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:56.57,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Vá ao campo de batalha, ao fronte, ao limite da sua vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:15:01.10,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\}Mostre a determinação da vida jogada fora.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.10,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Fogo! Fogo de barragem! Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:05.22,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Atenção! Proteja-se! Abaixe-se! Pare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.29,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Ouviu isso? Esse som de armas
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:13.02,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}é as vozes de vermes tentando resistir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:17.00,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Passe por cima deles! Passe por cima deles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.20,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Caros, qual é a nossa missão?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:20.05,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Extermínio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:22.10,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Não deixar sobrar nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.90,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&H3A3EB0&}Só há uma coisa a ser feita:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.25,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\blur8\3c&H1E23D6&}Criar o inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:28.77,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\blur8}Ir levar tiro nessa chuva de balas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:34.97,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Que pergunta ridícula! É pelo bem do império!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.60,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Vá ao campo de batalha, ao fronte, ao limite da sua vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.80,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Vida jogada fora, mostre a sua determinação!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:46.58,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Sua lealdade! Sua obediência! Então sua alma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:51.02,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Ofereça tudo e dê o grito da vitória.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:55.02,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}Mostre aqui que você pode juntar
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:16:01.00,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8}uma pilha de corpos que atinja os céus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.16,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Fogo! Fogo de barragem! Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:05.16,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Atenção! Proteja-se! Abaixe-se! Pare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.16,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Fogo! Fogo de barragem! Vai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.07,ED Tradução,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur8\3c&HAD4682&}Atenção! Proteja-se! Abaixe-se! Pare!
